<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dress Delivery Service</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            width: 420px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        p {
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
        }

        label {
            font-weight: bold;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 18px;
            padding: 12px;
            background-color: #0077cc;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #005fa3;
        }

        .result {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px;
            background-color: #eef7ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #0077cc;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #222;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Dress Delivery Service</h1>
        <p>Welcome to the On-Time Dress Delivery Service system.</p>
        <p>This project helps customers track dress orders and delivery updates.</p>

        <form method="POST">
            <label for="customer_name">Customer Name:</label>
            <input type="text" id="customer_name" name="customer_name" value="{{ customer_name }}" required>

            <label for="order_id">Order ID:</label>
            <input type="text" id="order_id" name="order_id" value="{{ order_id }}" required>

            <label for="dress_type">Dress Type:</label>
            <input type="text" id="dress_type" name="dress_type" value="{{ dress_type }}" required>

            <label for="delivery_status">Delivery Status:</label>
            <input type="text" id="delivery_status" name="delivery_status" value="{{ delivery_status }}" required>

            <button type="submit">Track Order</button>
        </form>

        {% if message %}
        <div class="result">
            {{ message }}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</body>
</html>